From 96240045d1564dd55772fd1b8cd278c88b6c7f72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:04:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): show the one radial-step field each pocket strategy
 reads

Adaptive and Offset rings step by Optimal load and never read Stepover;
the Passes tab showed both, so a Stepover edit looked ignored. The page
now shows Stepover only for Zigzag / Waterline / Auto and Optimal load
only for Adaptive / Offset rings (Pocket, 3D Pocket, rotary offset,
multi-axis rough, 2D Adaptive), driven by PocketStrategy::steps_by_load,
the same predicate the generators use. The 3D diameter check no longer
refuses a stale, unread stepover under the load strategies. The
past-reach refusal names the field and both values. Entry Engagement
and the trochoid Forward step get hints saying what they change.

Fixes #1512

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
